  <!-- Section 1: Executive Summary -->
  <h2 id="executive-summary">1. Executive Summary</h2>
  <p>This comprehensive report documents the development and implementation of the <strong>WIGMS (Wedding Invitation & Gift Management System)</strong>, a full-featured wedding management application originally built with C and GTK+, complemented by a web-based simulation using HTML/CSS/JavaScript and Figma design prototypes.</p>

