      <div class="stat-label">User Types</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 2: Project Overview -->
  <h2 id="project-overview" class="page-break">2. Project Overview</h2>

  <h3 id="app-description">2.1 Application Description</h3>
  <p>WIGMS is a comprehensive wedding management system that provides complete event planning and management capabilities. The system exists in two implementations:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Desktop Application:</strong> C language with GTK+ for native desktop deployment</li>
    <li><strong>Web Simulation:</strong> HTML/CSS/JavaScript for browser-based demonstration and prototyping</li>
  </ul>
  
  <p><strong>Core Features:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Category Management:</strong> Organize guests into categories (VIP, Family, Friends, Staff, Media)</li>
    <li><strong>Person Registration:</strong> Register guests with personal details and side assignment (Le marie / La mariee)</li>
    <li><strong>Seating Arrangement:</strong> Visual table assignments with meal preferences and dietary restrictions</li>
    <li><strong>Parking Management:</strong> Zone-based parking with VIP, Standard, Staff, and Bus areas</li>
    <li><strong>Gift Registry:</strong> Track gifts, values, and contributors</li>
    <li><strong>Priority Management:</strong> Sort guests using various criteria (age, class, merge sort)</li>
    <li><strong>Event Schedule:</strong> Timeline management with countdown and delay features</li>
  </ul>

