  <h3 id="css-stylesheet">5.1 CSS Stylesheet (styles.css)</h3>
  <p>The main stylesheet implements:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>CSS Variables:</strong> Root-level custom properties for consistent theming</li>
    <li><strong>GTK Theme Matching:</strong> Purple gradient background, styled buttons, tree-view tables</li>
    <li><strong>Animations:</strong> Flower float (15s), star twinkle (3s), table glow (10s), spot glow (10s)</li>
    <li><strong>Modal System:</strong> Dropdown overlays for seating hall and parking yard views</li>
    <li><strong>Responsive Design:</strong> Media queries for mobile/tablet compatibility</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="code-block">
/* Example: CSS Variables */
:root {
  --primary: #667eea;
  --primary-dark: #764ba2;
  --gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
  --danger: #FF6B6B;
  --text-dark: #2C3E50;
}
  </div>

