  <!-- Section 6: Key Features -->
  <h2 id="key-features" class="page-break">6. Key Features Implemented</h2>

  <h3 id="user-toggle">6.1 User Type Toggle (Admin/Guest)</h3>
  <p>Implemented using JavaScript and sessionStorage:</p>
  <div class="code-block">
// Toggle between Admin and Guest
function setUserType(type, save = true) {
  const body = document.body;
  if (type === 'guest') {
    body.classList.add('guest-mode');
    // Hide admin-only elements
  } else {
    body.classList.remove('guest-mode');
  }
  if (save) {
    sessionStorage.setItem('wigms-user-type', type);
  }
}
  </div>
  <p>User preference persists across page navigation using <code>sessionStorage</code>.</p>

  <h3 id="dropdown-modals">6.2 Dropdown Modals with Top-View</h3>
  <p>Seating and Parking pages feature dropdown modals instead of inline sidebars:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Saves Space:</strong> Button doesn't cover page content until clicked</li>
    <li><strong>Overlay Effect:</strong> Semi-transparent background covers page</li>
    <li><strong>Viewport Bound:</strong> Modal content scrolls within 90vh max-height</li>
    <li><strong>Close Actions:</strong> Click X button or click outside modal to close</li>
  </ul>

